@host = https://app-installflow.azurewebsites.net/
@contentType = application/json

### Logga in som admin — KÖR DENNA FÖRST
# @name login
POST {{host}}/api/auth
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "userName": "admin",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### Hämta alla kategorier (anonymt OK)
GET {{host}}/api/categories

### Slug-sökning
GET {{host}}/api/categories?slug=fiber

### Kategori på id
GET {{host}}/api/categories/13

### Kategori som inte finns → 404
GET {{host}}/api/categories/99999

### Skapa kategori → 201
# @name createCategory
POST {{host}}/api/categories
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

{
  "name": "Testkategori",
  "image": "/images/cat.png"
}

### JSON Patch — uppdatera namn → 200
PATCH {{host}}/api/categories/{{createCategory.response.body.$.id}}
Content-Type: application/json-patch+json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

[
  { "op": "replace", "path": "/name", "value": "Uppdaterad kategori" }
]

### Ta bort produkt från kategori
DELETE {{host}}/api/categories/2/products/1
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Negativtest — Name saknas → 400
POST {{host}}/api/categories
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

{
  "image": "/images/utannamn.png"
}

### Radera kategori → 204
DELETE {{host}}/api/categories/{{createCategory.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}




